# Local Worker secrets for `wrangler dev` / `opennextjs-cloudflare preview`.
# Copy to .dev.vars (git-ignored); never commit a value. EVERY KEY IS
# OPTIONAL: the Worker runs with this file absent.
#
# In stage/prod these are Worker secrets, not wrangler vars: set one with
# `wrangler secret put <NAME> --name ai-chatbot-web-<env>` (README); the
# deploy lane does not set them. The database is not here: the Worker reaches
# it through the HYPERDRIVE binding (wrangler.jsonc); attachments go to the
# BLOB bucket binding, and the models to the AI binding (Workers AI — remote
# even under `wrangler dev`, so `wrangler login` first).

# The session key. Unset, it is the one the database generated
# (migration 020_app_secrets; lib/auth-secret.ts).
# AUTH_SECRET=

# The Vercel AI Gateway: adds upstream's gateway models to the picker.
# AI_GATEWAY_API_KEY=

# Redis: resumable streams and the per-IP rate limit.
# REDIS_URL=

# Optional. Cloudflare Web Analytics token; build-time (NEXT_PUBLIC_) so it
# belongs in .env.local for `next build`, not here.
